@startuml power-fsm
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFD
  BorderColor #444444
}

state "SLEEP (0x01)" as SLEEP
state "ONE-SHOT (0x02)" as ONESHOT
state "CONTINUOUS (0x03)" as CONT

[*] --> SLEEP : power-on reset /\nend of probe

SLEEP --> ONESHOT : sysfs read of in_illuminance_raw\nwhile idle (no buffer, no events)
ONESHOT --> SLEEP : conversion done (HW auto-return):\nALS_OUT latched, ALS_RDY set, INT pulses

SLEEP --> CONT : buffer enabled OR\nthreshold event enabled
CONT --> SLEEP : last consumer disabled\n(!buffer_en && !ev_en)

note right of ONESHOT
  Transient state, used only for
  on-demand raw reads. Driver waits
  on a completion signalled by the
  IRQ thread (500 ms timeout).
end note

note right of CONT
  Conversion every cycle (200 ms).
  ALS_RDY each cycle, ALS_INT on
  threshold crossings. Raw reads
  skip ONE-SHOT and just read the
  latched ALS_OUT.
end note

note left of SLEEP
  Registers accessible,
  no measurements, latched
  ALS_OUT still readable.
  OFF (0x00) is never used.
end note
@enduml
